      "source": [
        "Looking at these charts, we can start drawing some conclusions about the two alliances. What stands out is that even though BRICS has three more countries, it’s still behind the G7. That said, the gap between them has been getting smaller over the years, showing that BRICS is growing, even though the G7 is still ahead in terms of GDP.\n",
        "\n",
        "This suggests that some countries' GDPs are growing faster than others. It will be interesting to analyze this race by looking at individual participants to see which countries are leading."
      ]
    },
