        "We’ll create a function that lets us pick a specific year and shows the ranking of countries based on their GDP for that year. Instead of looking at the alliances as a whole, this will help us compare individual countries and see who’s leading.\n",
        "\n",
        "We’ll also continue using red for G7 and blue for BRICS to easily distinguish which countries belong to BRICS and which are part of the G7."
