        "### Key Positions and Highlights\n",
        "\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "It’s interesting to look at this race. Here are some main points:\n",
        "\n",
        "*   The United States has been the all-time leader for the last 23 years.\n",
        "*   Ethiopia has consistently been at the bottom of the rankings during this\n",
        "period.\n",
        "*   China has shown remarkable growth, moving from 4th place in 2000 to 2nd in 2023.\n",
        "*   In 2023, Germany overtook Japan to claim 3rd place in this economic race.\n",
        "*   Within the G7, the only notable change since 2000 is Germany surpassing Japan, while the other members have remained in the same positions.\n",
        "*   In the BRICS race, China has been the consistent leader. Russia has remained 4th throughout, while Brazil held 2nd place until 2014, when India overtook it. Meanwhile, Saudi Arabia climbed from 8th place in 2000 to 5th in 2023."
      ],
