        "### Economic Race Through Multiple Graphics\n",
        "\n",
        "One of the key concepts we explored in class is how data can be transformed into other types of graphics and visualizations, which are visually appealing and offer a fresh perspective on the story it tells. So far, we’ve used straightforward methods like line charts and bar charts to present data. However, these other visualizations allow us to be more creative in how we showcase information."
