        "## **Final Thoughts and Future Directions**\n",
        "\n",
        "In conclusion, this project has shown me two key insights. First, data visualization is a powerful tool for understanding and interpreting information. Raw numbers can be overwhelming, but when presented through graphs, it becomes much easier to grasp the bigger picture and uncover meaningful trends, as we did with the GDP, alliances, and countries over time.\n",
