        "Second, data visualization doesn't have to be limited to conventional charts. With creativity, we can present data in new and engaging ways. By combining analysis with innovative design, we can tell even more compelling stories. Moving forward, I plan to continue this project, taking it a step further by creating visual designs on platforms like Illustrator, with the goal of turning the data into a poster or graphic that can communicate these insights in a unique and impactful way."
